        "LocalizationKey": "Forest_Lore_StandingStones_CardDescription",
        "DefaultText": "A ring of tall grey stones stands in a clearing of the wood, each leaning a little toward the one beside it, the north faces gone green with moss. On one stone, low down where the light finds it, someone cut runes long ago: Halfdan was here. The ground at the centre of the ring looks as if something was set down there and never taken up."
